# One context, two builders: the workspace image (whose Dockerfile copies
# the runtime files below) and the Tests stack's nginx image, which builds
# from this same directory through the tests/src symlink and additionally
# copies user-install.sh into its web root (ADR 0007). The workspace
# Dockerfile never copies the script — it only rides along in the context.
*
!01-home-bash-env.sh
!docker-entrypoint.sh
!home-env-mirror.sh
!sshd_config_ubuntu
!user-install.sh
